{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '断，对刘邦的威胁认识不足，在政治斗争', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '竟的事业——编撰一部', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '贯通古今的史学巨著。这一遗愿成为司马迁一生奋斗的重要动力。\n\n### 出生年代与地点\n\n关于司马迁的出生年代，学界存在多种说法，主要有：\n- **公元前145年说**：依据《太史公自序》推算，为多数学者采纳\n- **公元前135年说**：依据《正义》引《博物志》记载\n\n司马迁的出生地是左冯翊夏阳（今陕西省韩城市），这里是司马氏世代居住之地。龙门、岳庙等', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '韩城附近的古迹，与司马迁的少年时代有着千丝万缕的联系。\n\n---\n\n## 二、早年经历与求学时期\n\n### 童年与启蒙', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

