{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '历史评价**：巨鹿之战是秦末农民起义的决定性战役，此战消灭了秦军主力，加速了秦朝的灭亡。项羽在此战中展现出的军事天才——果断、勇敢、善于', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '抓住战机——使他成为天下诸侯的领袖。\n\n### 5. 坑杀秦军与', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '入关（公元前207年）\n\n**新安坑杀**：项羽率军西进途中，行', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '至新安，担心秦军降卒哗变，遂将二十余万秦军降卒全部坑杀，只留章邯、司马欣、董翳三人。这是一次极为残酷的屠杀，也使项羽在关中地区丧失了民心。\n\n**函谷关受阻**：刘邦先项羽入', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '，收集民间传说，验证史籍记载，为日后撰写《史记》奠定了坚实基础。司马迁在《太史公自序》中自豪地说："迁生龙门', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '关中，派兵守函谷关，企图独占关中。项羽大怒，攻破函谷关，驻军鸿门。\n\n---\n\n', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '## 四、与刘邦的楚汉相争\n\n### 1. 鸿门宴（公元前206年）\n\n**背景**：刘邦率先入关中，按照楚怀王的约定，“先入关中者王之”，刘邦欲在关中称王。项羽破关而入，两军对峙，大战一触即发。\n\n**宴请', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

