{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '良引项伯见刘邦，刘邦解释自己', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '，耕牧河山之阳。年十岁则诵古文。二十而南游江、淮，上会稽，探禹穴，窥九嶷，浮于沅、湘', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '并无称王之心，“吾入关，秋毫不敢有所近，籍吏民，封府库，而待将军。所以遣将守关者，备他盗之出入与非常也。日夜望将军至，岂敢反乎！愿伯具言臣之不敢倍德也”。\n- 项伯回营后劝项羽善待刘邦', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '，约定次日刘邦亲自前来谢罪。\n\n**宴会过程**：\n\n- 次日，刘邦率百余骑至鸿门，向项羽谢罪。\n', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

