{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '得巴蜀偏远之地，心怀不满。\n- 齐国故地三分，齐将田都', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '他讲授《春秋公羊传》。另一位重要老师是孔安国（孔子后裔），司马迁向他学习古文《尚书》，接受了系统的', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '、胶东王田巿、济北王田安瓜分齐地，原燕王韩广被赶到辽东，引发韩广不满。\n- 赵国故地分给张耳、陈余二人，陈余仅得三县，心中', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '怨恨。\n- 秦朝故地分给', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '三位降将，章邯等人因坑杀之仇，为关中百姓所怨恨。\n\n**', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '田荣起兵与刘邦还定三秦**：\n\n- 项羽分封不久，田荣率先在齐地起兵，击杀田都、田巿、田安，自立为齐王。\n- 刘邦趁乱“明修栈道，暗度陈仓”，还定三秦，夺取关中。\n- 陈余响应田', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '荣，在赵地起兵，驱逐张耳。\n\n**汉元年（前206年）四月，诸侯罢戏下，各归封国。八月', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4ed-7330-b40e-78879d50e751', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:8dc57837-ad49-ac67-0914-8c2cccfeddf2|model:3e34c0df-f186-8d4f-51e2-495afe4b1f0d', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

