{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '产生了深远影响：\n\n**批判精神**：司马迁敢于批判现实的批判精神，为后世士人树立了榜样。即使在专制时代，许多士大夫', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '仍以司马迁为榜样，坚持"良史"的品格。\n\n**人文关怀**：司马迁重视人的价值，同情弱者，反对暴政的人文', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '精神，影响', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '了后世的政治理念。\n\n**民族认同**：《史记》详细记载了各民族的历史，为中华民族多元一体格局的形成提供了史学依据。\n\n### 司马迁精神\n\n司马迁在遭受腐刑后忍辱负重、完成《史记》的经历，本身就成为后世的精神楷模。"人固有一死，或重于泰山，或轻于鸿毛"这句名言，成为激励无数仁人志士的精神力量。\n\n### 后世评价\n\n历代名家对司马迁给予了极高评价：\n\n- **刘向、扬雄**："其文直，其事核，不虚美，不隐恶，故谓之', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '实录。"\n- **韩愈**："汉朝人莫不能文，独司马相如、太史公之流为文之尤。"\n- **苏轼**："文章', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '西汉两司马。"\n- **鲁迅**："史家之绝唱，无韵之《离骚》。"\n- **毛泽东**："司马迁览潇湘，泛西湖', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '，历昆仑，周览名山大川，而其襟怀乃益广。"\n\n---\n\n## 结语\n\n司马迁以"隐忍苟活"换', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '来的《史记》，不仅是中国古代史学的巅峰之作，更是中华文明的重要遗产。他忍辱负重的精神、秉笔直书的', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '史学品格、关注民生的人文情怀，至今仍具有重要的现实意义。司马迁用他的一生诠释了什么是"知其不可而为之', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '"的执着，什么是"究天人之际，通古今之变"的学术追求，什么是"成一家之言"的独立精神。\n\n《史记》作为"史家之绝唱，无韵之离', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=[{'text': '骚"，将永远闪耀在中华文明的历史星空，而司马迁——这位"史圣"的名字，也将永远被后人铭记。', 'type': 'text', 'index': 1}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'anthropic'}, id='lc_run--019e0164-d4c8-74a2-a76e-d22e244e68e7', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 2, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49|model:8ea3aef5-58b0-79f0-d392-e5295d161fe4', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:3915a820-1ff7-ef6e-f827-4c5120e26f49', 'ls_provider': 'anthropic', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None, 'ls_max_tokens': 4096})}

